{34}{I am called Neddao. Neddao Wallau. I am Lord Mayor and Chief Magistrate for the Shire of Brandybuck. You can call me Neddao - everyone else does. [He is nonplussed about that]}{I am called Neddao. Neddao Wallau. I am Lord Mayor and Chief Magistrate for the Shire of Brandybuck. You can call me Neddao - everyone else does. [He is nonplussed about that]}{}{}{}{}
