{100}{[He thinks for a moment] Well, there is a pack of wolves at each end of town that's getting a little too brave for their own good. Why don't you be a sport and dispatch one of them as you leave?}{[He thinks for a moment] Well, there is a pack of wolves at each end of town that's getting a little too brave for their own good. Why don't you be a dear and dispatch one of them as you leave?}{}{}{}{}
