{110}{Oh.... well. Let's see now. We're the largest remaining shire in all of Arcanum. In case you're unfamiliar with our customs, in order for one of our communities to be called a shire, there can be no more than two members of the other races living there. Otherwise, it's just a town.}{Oh.... well. Let's see now. We're the largest remaining shire in all of Arcanum. In case you're unfamiliar with our customs, in order for one of our communities to be called a shire, there can be no more than two members of the other races living there. Otherwise, it's just a town.}{}{}{}{}
{111}{I did not know that. I appreciate you enlightening me. Please, continue.}{}{5}{}{113}{}
{112}{Me not know dat. Tanks. Please, go on.}{}{-4}{}{113}{}
{113}{Brandybuck is also considered to be the wealthiest shire around due to the abundance of wool, potatoes, and tobacco we export each year. Through centuries of carefull breeding our sheep produce the softest wool to be found anywhere in the land and our soil, once we removed most of the rocks, is perfect for the growing of most crops.. }{Brandybuck is also considered to be the wealthiest shire around due to the abundance of wool, potatoes, and tobacco we export each year. Through centuries of carefull breeding our sheep produce the softest wool to be found anywhere in the land and our soil, once we removed most of the rocks, is perfect for the growing of most crops.. }{}{}{}{}
{114}{[You listen]}{}{1}{}{115}{}
{115}{Let's see, we're still considered to be part of Cumbria, although we operate more like an independant city-state. King Praetor's tax-men find their way here once a year, collect their gold, then leave us in peace again. So, we take care of our own affairs. }{Let's see, we're still considered to be part of Cumbria, although we operate more like an independant city-state. King Praetor's tax-men find their way here once a year, collect their gold, then leave us in peace again. So, we take care of our own affairs. }{}{}{}{}
{116}{[You listen]}{}{1}{}{119}{}
{117}{Oh, look at the time! I don't mean to seem rude, but I must be getting along.}{}{5}{}{126}{}
{118}{Oh! Me must go now. Utter tings to be done today. Me must go now.}{}{-4}{}{126}{}
{119}{Being a rural shire, there's not too much in the way of tourist interests, I'm afraid. There's a medicine show that comes around once a year, soon after that is our harvest festival. But other than that, the only real excitement we've had lately is when the Vlafa place caught fire.}{Being a rural shire, there's not too much in the way of tourist interests, I'm afraid. There's a medicine show that comes around once a year, soon after that is our harvest festival. But other than that, the only real excitement we've had lately is when the Vlafa place caught fire.}{}{}{}{}
{120}{I hope no one was hurt!}{}{5}{}{122}{}
{121}{Me hope no one got hurt!}{}{-4}{}{122}{}
{122}{Thankfully, no. But it did put them into a bit of a bind. Until they can afford to rebuild, they are having to live out of their barn. They shouldn't be in there too much longer though as their oldest boy, Lasou, went to Cattan to get some money from a rich relative.}{Thankfully, no. But it did put them into a bit of a bind. Until they can afford to rebuild, they are having to live out of their barn. They shouldn't be in there too much longer though as their oldest boy, Lasou, went to Cattan to get some money from a rich relative.}{}{}{}{}
{123}{Well, thank you for the information. You've been most helpful. Good day to you.}{}{5}{}{126}{}
{124}{Tanks for tellin' me. That stuff good to know. Bye.}{}{-4}{}{126}{}
{125}{K:}{}{1}{}{38}{}
{126}{Good day to you. Now, if you'll excuse me, I must get back to my duties. The nearest way out of town is just up the road a piece. }{Good day to you. Now, if you'll excuse me, I must get back to my duties. The nearest way out of town is just up the road a piece. }{}{}{}{}
{127}{I say!}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{128}{'Ere now!}{}{-4}{}{0}{}
{129}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{130}{[He gazes at you in disbelief for a moment before walking away and muttering] Oh, Frigo! Frigo! What have you done to us?!}{[He gazes at you in disbelief for a moment before walking away and muttering] Oh, Frigo! Frigo! What have you done to us?!}{}{}{}{}
{131}{And greetings to you too. neighbor!}{And greetings to you too. neighbor!}{}{}{}{}

{150}{Why do you want to know? [He looks at you suspiciously] You're not thinking of living there are you?}{Why do you want to know? [He looks at you suspiciously] You're not thinking of living there are you?}{}{}{}{}
{151}{Not really, but I do travel quite a bit, and if I should hear of someone looking for a place of their own, having some details would be nice.}{}{5}{}{157}{}
{152}{Actually, I just might. The place is charming, and this might be a good place to retire to.}{}{5}{}{168}{}
{153}{Perhaps. Perhaps not. I do try to keep my eyes open for an good investment possibility. I can see rental prospects here.}{}{5}{}{187}{}
{154}{Not really, but me do travel a lot. If me hear someone wantin' a place, know'n things about dis would be nice.}{}{-4}{}{157}{}
{155}{Yuh! Me like da little hole. It comfy inside. Me learn to duck head. Heh!}{}{-4}{}{168}{}
{156}{Maybe and maybe not. Me tinks me can rent dis place to little people an' dey give me money!}{}{-4}{}{187}{}
{157}{Oh, well! Yes! Yes, indeed! [He looks quite relieved] There's not much more to tell besides what you can see with your own two eyes. It's a small place, but has about two acres of good, cleared land. And it has a deep well that has never run dry. I think the only reason Mr. Furbottom is selling it is because he got a bit over-extended. There was a drop in tobacco prices and that happens to be his main source of income.}{Oh, well! Yes! Yes, indeed! [He looks quite relieved] There's not much more to tell besides what you can see with your own two eyes. It's a small place, but has about two acres of good, cleared land. And it has a deep well that has never run dry. I think the only reason Mr. Furbottom is selling it is because he got a bit over-extended. There was a drop in tobacco prices and that happens to be his main source of income.}{}{}{}{}
{158}{I see. Thank you. Do you happen to know how much he's asking for the place?}{}{5}{}{160}{}
{159}{Tanks! That stuff is good to know. Uhh... Do you know how much Mr. Fur-bottom (snicker) wants for place?}{}{-4}{}{160}{}
{160}{He was asking 75,000 until recently. I heard that he lowered the asking price, but I'm afraid I don't know what the current one is.}{He was asking 75,000 until recently. I heard that he lowered the asking price, but I'm afraid I don't know what the current one is.}{}{}{}{}
{161}{Less than 75,000, eh? I just might know of someone who would be interested. Where might I find this Furbottom, chap?}{}{5}{}{163}{}
{162}{Less dan 75,000, eh? Me might know of someone. Where does dis Frigo Fur-bottom [smile] live?}{}{-4}{}{163}{}
{163}{He lives in the South Farthing - Oh, wait! I just seen him going towards the town square. If you hurry, you might catch him!}{He lives in the South Farthing - Oh, wait! I just seen him going towards the town square. If you hurry, you might catch him!}{}{}{}{gf 2802 1}
{164}{Thank you. I'll be going now.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{165}{Tanks! Me go now!}{}{-4}{}{0}{}
{166}{K:}{}{1}{}{38}{}
{167}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{168}{Oh, goodness gracious me! You don't a hobbit-hole to live in. You are human! Stand tall, be proud of your heritage, and all that! Not be all hunched over and banging your head on the ceiling every other step. No, no. You don't want that. Trust me, my good man, you'd be much happier in a place like Tarant, Caladon, Black Root, or even - oh, what's that place? - Shrouded Hills! Be among your own kind.}{Oh, goodness gracious me! You don't a hobbit-hole to live in. You are human! Stand tall, be proud of your heritage, and all that! Not be all hunched over and banging your head on the ceiling every other step. No, no. You don't want that. Trust me, my good lady, you'd be much happier in a place like Tarant, Caladon, Black Root, or even - oh, what's that place? - Shrouded Hills! Be among your own kind.}{}{}{}{}
{169}{But I like it here. This place, this entire community, has a homey feeling to it.}{}{5}{}{173}{}
{170}{Perhaps you're right. Just the same, in case I meet someone who is looking for a place, perhaps I should speak with Mr. Furbottom.}{}{5}{}{180}{}
{171}{But me like it here! Dis place has a comfy feel to it.}{}{-4}{}{173}{}
{172}{Maybe you right. Ah! If me do find someone to buy it, maybe me should talk to Mr. Fur-bottom [snicker] and learn more.}{Maybe you right. Ah! If me do find someone to buy it, maybe me should talk to Mr. Fur-bottom [snicker] and learn more.}{-4}{}{180}{}
