{620}{You won't regret it, my good fellow! This place is a real beauty with solid construction and plenty of room for expansion after you finish sowing your wild oats.}{You won't regret it, my good lady! This place is a real beauty with solid construction and plenty of room for expansion after you decide to raise a family. Yes, indeed. }{}{}{}{}
