{630}{Why yes. The practice of an absentee landlord is not completely unknown to us. I, personally collect the rent on three establishments for a gentleman who resides in Tarant.}{Why yes. The practice of an absentee landlady is not completely unknown to us. I, personally collect the rent on three establishments for a gentleman who resides in Tarant.}{}{}{}{}
{631}{In that case, I shall cetrainly keep you in mind. Perhaps I could retain your services as well.}{}{5}{}{632}{}
{632}{Indeed! Now then, is there anything else I can assist you with?}{Indeed! Now then, is there anything else I can assist you with?}{}{}{}{}
{633}{K:}{}{1}{}{38}{}
