{656}{Maybe and maybe not. Me tinks me can rent dis place to little people an' dey give me money!}{}{-4}{}{687}{}
{657}{Oh, well! Yes! Yes, indeed! [He looks mildly disappointed] There's not much more to tell besides what you can see with your own two eyes. It's a small place, but has about two acres of good, cleared land. And it has a deep well that has never run dry. I think the only reason Mr. Furbottom is selling it is because he got a bit over-extended. There was a drop in tobacco prices and that happens to be his main source of income.}{Oh, well! Yes! Yes, indeed! [He looks mildly disappointed] There's not much more to tell besides what you can see with your own two eyes. It's a small place, but has about two acres of good, cleared land. And it has a deep well that has never run dry. I think the only reason Mr. Furbottom is selling it is because he got a bit over-extended. There was a drop in tobacco prices and that happens to be his main source of income.}{}{}{}{}
{658}{I see. Thank you. Do you happen to know how much he's asking for the place?}{}{5}{}{660}{}
